sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant GIS as Google Sign-In
  participant PX as /api/proxy
  participant N as Node BFF
  participant FS as Firestore
  B->>GIS: Sign in
  GIS-->>B: ID token (memory only)
  B->>PX: POST /api/auth/login with ID token
  PX->>N: Forward with Origin and infra OIDC
  N->>N: Verify signature, aud, iss, exp, email_verified, hd
  N->>FS: Transaction - find identity link or create user and link
  N->>FS: Create login session (SHA-256 of session ID)
  N-->>B: Set-Cookie opaque session ID, profile
  B->>B: Discard ID token
  B->>PX: Any API call with cookie
  PX->>N: Forward cookie and Origin
  N->>FS: Resolve session and user status (cached 10 s)
  alt Expired, revoked or disabled
    N-->>B: 401 or 403, show sign-in
  else Valid
    N-->>B: Response for owner key
  end
